{"id":"d_main_24_13","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch24","label":"Chapter 24 · Banishment"},"label":"Threat From Within","stage":"24-37 STAGE · Start","prev":"d_main_24_12","next":"d_main_24_14_s","speakers":{"Narration":"Narration","nihilister_a":"Nihilister","dorothy":"Dorothy","enikk_op_l":"Enikk","Self":"Commander","rapi":"Rapi","anis":"Anis","neon":"Neon"},"icons":{"Narration":"si_c999_00_s","nihilister_a":"si_c261_00_s","dorothy":"si_c233_00_s","enikk_op_l":"si_c904_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_24_13_1","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_1","text":"M.M.R. Core.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"AtlasCage_03","bgArt":"atlascage_03","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_mystery","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_2","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_2","text":"Several Nikkes are lying on the ground, motionless.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_3","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_3","text":"Nihilister stands in the middle, surrounded by the fallen Nikkes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["nihilister_a"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_4","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_4","text":"The Atlas Cage that once contained her has been melted from the inside.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_5","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_5","text":"The very contraption which was once thought unescapable is now little more than a gooey puddle.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_6","text":"Well well, what do we have here?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_7","text":"You're the one from Eden, aren't you? What are you doing here?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["dorothy"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_8","text":"Nihilister. You recovered faster than I thought you would.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_9","text":"Hmm? How did you know about that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_10","text":"Wait a moment.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_11","text":"You're the one who snuck up on me, weren't you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_12","text":"That's right. You've got so many exposed vital areas, it was like shooting fish in a barrel.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_13","text":"Hahaha!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_14","text":"You're quite a crack shot.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_15","text":"So good in fact, that you were able to hit the exact spot I wanted you to, dead nuts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_16","text":"You allowed yourself to get shot?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_17","text":"Of course. How else was I supposed to play dead and have it be convincing?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_18","text":"I knew these morons would take me to the Ark straight away to try and start dissecting me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_19","text":"No flames are hot enough for these puny insects.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_20","text":"But I must admit, the never-ending stupidity of humans never ceases to amuse me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_21","text":"They always end up getting too greedy and tripping over themselves.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_22","text":"You didn't have to drag me all the way here though.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_23","text":"You know what it feels like to have your head dragged across the ground for miles? It's no picnic!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_24","text":"You're going through an awful lot of trouble.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_25","text":"Oh, believe me, for what I'm planning, it's all gonna be worth it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_26","text":"I won't bother asking.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_27","text":"You're going to fail anyway.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_28","text":"Haha. Is that what you think?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_29","text":"... Wait.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_30","text":"Where did your weapons go?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_31","text":"Hahaha! You only noticed that just now? You're dumber than I thought.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_32","text":"I had to feed them,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"nihilister_a","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_33","text":"so they'd grow big and strong!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_34","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_35","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_35","text":"Dorothy scans her surroundings at once.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_36","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_36","text":"A pervasive silence consumes the room, quiet enough to be unnerving.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_37","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_37","text":"*Shooo*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_38","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_38","text":"Several tentacles break through the Atlas Cage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_39","text":"Excuse me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CommanderRoom","bgArt":"commanderroom","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":["enikk_op_l","neon","anis","rapi"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_40","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_40","text":"Enikk?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_41","text":"Proceed to M.M.R. immediately.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_42","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_42","text":"What's wrong?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_43","text":"There's a large amount of Alva particles emitting from deep inside M.M.R.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_emergency","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_44","text":"It's impossible to conduct any scans, so the current situation is unclear.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_45","text":"The Ark is rallying its forces and dispatching them to M.M.R.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_46","text":"Please hurry and meet with them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_47","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_47","text":"I'm assuming there's something else?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_48","text":"There is. That's why I contacted you directly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_49","text":"... Tell us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_50","text":"The Alva particle concentration there is some of the highest we've ever seen. We only saw numbers like this a few times before.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_51","text":"One of those instances was during an engagement with the Heretic Indivilia.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Factory","bgArt":"factory","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["indivilia"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_52","text":"During this skirmish, Indivilia was seriously injured due to a joint attack from Matis and Absolute. As it fled, it began reversing the damage it sustained.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_53","text":"At that time, ultra-high concentrations of Alva particles were observed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CommanderRoom","bgArt":"commanderroom","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["enikk_op_l","neon","anis","rapi"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_54","text":"It jams all communication devices in the immediate vicinity,\nand shuts down most of a Nikke's functions.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_55","text":"It operates essentially as a smoke screen to buy itself time to retreat.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_56","text":"Material H, which is also being kept secure in the Atlas Cage,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"AtlasCage_03","bgArt":"atlascage_03","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_57","text":"is a fragment of the Heretic Indivilia.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_24_13_58","text":"Nihilister's intention all along was to get access to M.M.R.'s core.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["nihilister_a"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_24_13_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk_op_l","ke